<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50391" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnātĭcus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		venatus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			hunting</i>, <i>hunting-.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canis,</span>”
				<i>a hunting-dog</i>, <i>hound</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 2, 2, 113</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 13, § 31</span></i>;
			cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus canum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 9, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">catulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 2, 65</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: prolatis rebus parasiti venatici
			sumus, i. e. <i>lean</i> or <i>gaunt like
				hounds</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 1, 1, 17</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
